{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212690","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212690","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121269001:1":{"text":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","source_cn":"朋友，进展如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D136DC5E832BDAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","female":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","variant_male_record_index":"117494","variant_female_record_index":"117495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121269001":{"text":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","source_cn":"朋友，进展如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D136DC5E832BDAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","female":"友よ、進展はあったのか？","variant_male_record_index":"117494","variant_female_record_index":"117495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121269002:0":{"text":"そうか……メイか。暖かな、いい名前だな。こうして君と改めて知り合えたことをうれしく思うよ。","source_cn":"是吗……五月，是个温暖的名字。很高兴以这样的方式重新认识你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F2DDEF6FFCACC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121269003:0":{"text":"アタシは、自分の罪から逃げたくない。だから戻ってきた。どんな罰でも受けるよ。","source_cn":"我不想逃避罪责，于是回来了。无论什么样的惩罚，我都接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F4263A0115AD315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121269004:0":{"text":"その姿勢に敬意を表しよう。","source_cn":"对此，我向你表示敬意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B6321F21368BE30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121269005:1":{"text":"ではメイよ、俺の部下が君を連れていく。そのうち判決が下るだろう。","source_cn":"那么五月，请你随我的士兵离开，等候审判吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49FE9958C65EDC67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121269006:0":{"text":"……うん。","source_cn":"嗯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D95B7400BEFF62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1121269007:0":{"text":"兵士がメイを連れ去った。いなくなる前に彼女はあなたたちをじっと見つめ、再びお礼を言っているようだった。","source_cn":"士兵将五月带走了，临走前，她深深地望向了我们，似乎又说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A5C396CFB1B7CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121269008:0":{"text":"実は、メイの前では言えないことがあって……","source_cn":"有些事情，当着五月的面，我一直不敢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E505A3D03EA6775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1121269008":{"text":"実は、メイの前では言えないことがあって……","source_cn":"有些事情，当着五月的面，我一直不敢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E505A3D03EA6775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121269009:0":{"text":"アルドン様が、メイの病状を分析した結果、ミス・クロガネが彼女にどんな恐ろしい魔法をかけたのか分かったの……","source_cn":"根据五月的病症，雅顿贤者已经推测出黑金女士在她身上用了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3697141299D8D009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121269010:0":{"text":"私は魔法のことは分からないから、ほとんど理解できなかったけど、なんでも体の時間の流れを加速させる黒魔術だって……","source_cn":"我不懂魔法，听得云里雾里，那好像是一种能让身体的时间流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x371F7A68EC06FD95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121269011:0":{"text":"植物を育てるときに触媒を与えて、成長を促すのと同じ感じかも。","source_cn":"有些地方培育作物时会加入催化剂，让作物的生长速度变快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9698371DE5B277C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121269012:0":{"text":"そして、彼女がアルファⅪって呼ばれていたのは……","source_cn":"我猜，她被叫做阿尔法十一也是这个原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB6B25947DB534E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121269013:0":{"text":"きっと、彼女の前にも、ミス・クロガネの実験台にされた子たちがいたからよ。でもアルファⅩやアルファⅨたちは、恐らくもう……","source_cn":"在她之前，黑金女士也进行过类似的实验。只是阿尔法十和阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2F221767A003C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121269014:0":{"text":"この件については必ず徹底的に捜査し、やつらの黒幕を暴き出してやる！","source_cn":"我们一定会严查此事，早日揭开他们的黑幕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2ADAC9759AEA279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121269015:0":{"text":"私もブラックゴールド商会の動向を見張っておくわ。手がかりが見つかったら手紙で知らせる。あなたたちも何か分かったらいつでも連絡して。","source_cn":"我也会多留意黑金商会的动向，要是有什么线索，我会写信告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6AFD0C1E353537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121269016:0":{"text":"ああ、貴殿と会えたことを光栄に思うよ、ラミア殿。","source_cn":"当然，能与你相识，我很荣幸。蕾米雅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FEF91BD50BAFC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121269017:0":{"text":"お互い社交辞令はなしにしましょ。じゃ、私はもう行くわ。旅の灯りの料理が忘れられないの！","source_cn":"少说客套话。那我先走一步，我还惦记着旅人灯火的饭菜呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB132DE7D7CF37D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121269018:0":{"text":"バイバイ、またね～","source_cn":"拜拜啦二位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2E48A9976BEB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2